  "body": "**Description:**\r\n\r\nCurrently the `public_baseurl` isn't validated, not by the Synapse instance itself or by the federationtester.matrix.org.\r\n\r\nIt took quite some time to figure out the public base URL was incorrectly configured on my Synapse instance. Maybe it's wise to add some validator/check to Synapse or the federationtester or both :+1: .\r\n\r\nRelated issue: #8469 \r\n\r\nDebug logging wasn't helping either.\r\n\r\nWill be appreciated by others. Thanks.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nMelroy van den Berg\r\n\r\n",
